[Day visitors are welcomed] at no extra charge but must observe any site rules and[ are not] allowed to stay[ overnight.]
No furniture or furnishings whatsoever to be taken out of wigwams at any time.
Only bbq and fire pit supplied to be used wood can be purchased when needed.
Any breakages must be reported immediately and paid for to the satisfaction of the management[.]
Leave utilities as you would like to find[.]
Any belongings left behind in accommodation[ must] be claimed within two weeks of departure[.]
All accommodation provided at Secret Valley is[ inspected] on your departure, please do not spoil the pleasure of the next visitors by leaving the accommodation dirty[.]
Please ensure pets are kept on leads at all times and[ are] not to foul apart from in designated area[.]
Please[ do] not leave pets unattended and[ not let] them annoy others[.]
The[ management] reserves the right to refuse admission or eject from the park any dog which it considers inappropriate as a family pet or a danger to others[.]
The[ management] reserves the[ right] to terminate the booking of any persons whose conduct is detrimental to the campsite or other visitors[.]
All persons staying at Secret Valley or visiting use facilities provided entirely at their own risk, Secret Valley[ cannot accept] any liability for loss, damage or accident to persons or property.
In the event of any serious breach of the above conditions, Secret Valley reserves the right to terminate a holiday and ask offenders to leave.
Remember that[ you will] be staying on a[ working] farm with[ live] animals and potentially dangerous farm equipment amongst other hazards, therefore observe the no entry signs and DO NOT enter any areas of the farm that are not permitted.
